# Neptune EHSS frontend

**Read [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) at the repo root before writing code.** It is the source of
truth; this file is the short form.

Next.js 16 App Router · React 19 · TypeScript · Tailwind v4 · TanStack Query v5 · TanStack
Table v8 · axios. Next 16 has breaking API changes — read `node_modules/next/dist/docs/` before
touching framework code. React Compiler is on: no `useMemo` / `useCallback` / `memo` for
performance.

## Branches

Work on `hamid`, push `origin/hamid`, PR into **`origin/dev`** (the latest). The backend is `connect-codeswift/Neptune-Ehss-BE`
on `origin/Staging`, and it serves five frontends.

## Commands

`npm run dev` · `npm run build` (the real typecheck) · `npm run lint` · `npm run format`.
No tests.

## Data layer — one way, no shortcuts

`src/dtos/req|res/<domain>-{request,response}.dto.ts` → `src/services/<domain>.service.ts`
(axios `http`, one async function per endpoint) → `src/services/mappers/<domain>.mapper.ts` →
`src/hooks/use-<domain>-queries|mutations.ts` (TanStack Query) →
`src/components/<module>/<Thing>Content.tsx`.

- Responses are wrapped in `ApiEnvelopeDto<T>` (`dtos/res/api-envelope.dto.ts`). The **service**
  is the only layer allowed to touch raw/unknown shapes; it unwraps `dataModel` and normalizes
  the backend's mixed camelCase/PascalCase with per-file coercion helpers (`isRecord`,
  `readProp`, `asString`, …). That duplication is deliberate — don't hoist it unasked.
- Query keys are a `<domain>QueryKeys` factory object with an `all` key. Queries apply the
  mapper via `select` and thread an explicit `enabled`; mutations invalidate
  `<domain>QueryKeys.all`.
- UI domain types live in `src/components/<module>/<module>-types.ts`.
- `<Thing>Content.tsx` is the repeated route shape — a client component owning fetching for one
  route. Copy the nearest one.
- `src/store/` (Redux Toolkit) is for the audit / inspection template wizards only. Server state
  is TanStack Query.
- The contract is `FEGuides/<Module>.md` in `connect-codeswift/Neptune-Ehss-BE`. Read it; don't guess shapes.
  `sw.json` is a stale Swagger dump, not the contract.

## Auth

Tokens live in `src/lib/axios.ts` (localStorage + in-memory). `AppShell.tsx` gates on the access
token. Permissions are `Module.Action` strings from the JWT (`src/lib/jwt-permissions.ts`) —
gate UI on them, but treat them as UX only; the backend enforces role AND permission. Sidebar
and licensed modules come from `GET api/Auth/Org/me` via `src/lib/ehs-modules.ts` and
`src/lib/app-nav.ts`.

## Components

`src/components/<module>/` per feature; `src/components/ui/` for shared primitives — check it
before building a control. Icons via `@iconify/react`; toasts via `src/lib/toast.ts`.
Props are `Readonly` (see `react-readonly-props.mdc`). `"use client"` only where needed.

## Styling

Tailwind v4, tokens in `@theme inline` in `src/app/globals.css`, all prefixed `ehs-`
(`ehs-normal-blue`, `ehs-border`, `ehs-muted-text`, …). Use tokens, not raw hex. Spacing scale
and gradients: see `tailwind-v4-utilities.mdc`.
